re likely against fewer opponents and is determined by comparing %0.2f times your stealth power (currently %d) to the stealth detection (reduced by 10%% per tile distance) of all enemies that have a clear line of sight to you.\n\t\tYour base chance of success is 100%% if you are not directly observed, and good or bad luck may also affect it.\n\t\tYou estimate your current chance to maintain stealth as %0.1f%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你学会在潜行状态下使用一些通常会打破潜行的技能（如攻击，使用物品……）当你在隐身状态下这么做的时候，你有一定概率不会打破潜行状态。\n\t\t面对的对手越少，成功率越高；你的成功率取决于你潜行强度的%0.2f倍（当前值 %d），以及所有视线能及你的敌人的侦测潜行能力（离你距离每有一格则下降10%%）。\n\t\t当你不在敌人的视野内时，基础成功率为 100%%，这一几率还受你的运气影响。\n\t\t你估计当前成功率为 %0.1f%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2c039d8c99f5d4afcefda70acdfb272d75dc652be812fcb00dc72db477579ac7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e548a5abcaeae2804abf2a83d5f2dc46c1b9d6cc4f35ea83efef27a7e8b96fab","logical_entry_identity":"ca0844fe6b6c5324ec8100adeb2c598bcd78fe023b63f473a3dfe12340569316","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Snipe","source_tag":"_t","target":"狙击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bddbc24eb52b41f1abea1e426efe091075ea0e2e65f0cf255fd49683cfe70fd4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e54e9cabba03e8cb2dd9330725cf571ff9b8ec58e2f73181dacbcd3667810803","logical_entry_identity":"5ccee028cd6ba0a6efd794db4298a37183083900ba82985461d9669d81624f41","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Set Up","source_tag":"talent name","target":"故卖破绽"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cebfb185d76719fdbab3963ea92c5d6f7bf630fb09780149b5144c7eac9938ba","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e553df08c3a0f810f379d59aa65adfe2aadb77a0444678ed39fafebb5458835d","logical_entry_identity":"0bc4e7526d5f6f9c51fafe5d3ba4676aa2f8ebd0181b29e571897c4a832d3a22","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"It is a humanoid with an aura of power. You notice a sharp set of front teeth.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这是一个散发着力量气场的类人生物，你注意到它长着一副锋利的门牙。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c